|----|-------------|
| KB5008380 | November 2021 patch |
| KB5008602 | OOB patch |
| KB5008207 | Cumulative update |

## Remediation
1. Apply KB5008380 patch
2. Set MachineAccountQuota to 0
3. Monitor Event 4741 and 4781 for anomalies
4. Enable PAC validation on all DCs
