## CLI Usage

```bash
python scripts/agent.py \
  --type operational \
  --data /cases/intel_data.json \
  --output-dir /cases/reports/ \
  --output report_meta.json
```

## Report Types

| Type | Audience | Length | Frequency |
|------|----------|--------|-----------|
