- Splunk ES RBA Docs: https://docs.splunk.com/Documentation/ES/latest/Admin/RBA
- Splunk SDK Python: https://github.com/splunk/splunk-sdk-python
- MITRE ATT&CK Detection: https://attack.mitre.org/resources/
