- [Microsoft Entra PIM Documentation](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/entra/id-governance/privileged-identity-management/pim-configure)
- [Plan a PIM Deployment](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/entra/id-governance/privileged-identity-management/pim-deployment-plan)
- [Start Using PIM](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/entra/id-governance/privileged-identity-management/pim-getting-started)
- [Microsoft Graph PIM API](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/graph/api/resources/privilegedidentitymanagementv3-overview)$S$, '{"browse_web","http_get","python_exec","create_deliverable"}', $S${"source":"mukul975/Anthropic-Cybersecurity-Skills","pack":"cybersecurity","domain":"cybersecurity","subdomain":"identity-access-management","tags":["Code","Testing","Research","Automation","Security","Compliance","Cloud","Data"],"files":3}$S$::jsonb, true)
